{"id":"navstrechu","lemma":"навстречу","pos":"prep","rank":3132,"glosses":["toward, towards"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/05/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B2%D1%81%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%87%D1%83.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B2%D1%81%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%87%D1%83.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Навстречу нам идёт женщина.","en":"A woman is walking towards us.","words":[null,{"g":"(to) us","l":"мы"},{"g":"to go","l":"идти"},{"g":"woman"}]},{"text":"Спасибо, что пошли навстречу.","en":"Thank you for meeting me halfway.","words":[{"g":"thank you, thanks"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"to go","l":"пойти"},null]},{"text":"Собака бежала ему навстречу.","en":"The dog was running toward him.","words":[{"g":"dog"},{"g":"to run, to be running","l":"бежать"},{"g":"(to) him","l":"он"},null]},{"text":"Ты не пойдёшь мне навстречу?","en":"Won't you meet me halfway?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to go","l":"пойти"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null]},{"text":"Я иду навстречу её требованиям.","en":"I meet her demands.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go","l":"идти"},null,{"g":"her"},null]}]}